    "document": "Synthetic Core Rules",
    "section": "3. Shooting Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "3.01",
    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, each of your units that is **eligible to shoot** shoots in turn.\n\nFor each unit:\n\n1. Select targets for its ranged weapons.\n2. Resolve those attacks.\n3. Select the next unit.\n\nA unit that has no eligible target cannot be selected.",
